1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
 It was a decision.

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,200
 Like after the invasion of Ukraine, Montreal has decided to invite the consul general of

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,540
 La Russie to the Hôtel de Ville.

4
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:10,900
 Today, the first minister israelite is positioned by a warrant of the international court court

5
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:14,100
 and the city chose to honor its official representative.

6
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:19,680
 I ask another question: who has taken this decision and according to which ethical criteria?

7
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:24,700
 Does the administration consider that there is a limit of ethics or is that no matter

8
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,900
 of which the representative should be imposed?

9
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:29,900
 Yes, Ms. Stéphanie Valenzuela.

10
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:31,900
 Thank you.

11
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:36,900
 Thank you, Ms. President.

12
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:39,700
 In fact, I invite my colleagues from the other side to look at the "Livre d'or"

13
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:45,200
 who was signed by all the consul general who was appointed in the last mandat.

14
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:49,700
 You will see that this is not something that has just been taken as decision by our administration.

15
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,700
 It is something that is protocol.

16
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:54,900
 And we follow the protocol and the expertise of our Department of Protocols.

17
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:55,900
 Thank you.

18
00:00:55,900 --> 00:01:01,900
 Thank you, Mr. Christopher McCray.

19
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:05,900
 Thank you, Ms. President.

20
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:09,300
 In the electoral campaign, the Ensemble Montréal has promised to listen and act.

21
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:12,700
 In the report of the "Voies cyclables", it seems to put an accent on the subject of "Agir"

22
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:15,900
 before listening to the experts or people who depend on these facilities

23
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:17,900
 to be placed in security.

24
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:23,100
 According to a article published in October 27th, the "Isodite des pistes cyclables"

25
00:01:23,100 --> 00:01:26,100
 commandées by the administration at the cost of $1 million,

26
00:01:26,100 --> 00:01:30,100
 did not recommend the dismantlement of any of the pistes cyclables studied.

27
00:01:30,100 --> 00:01:33,100
 However, a few days after the publication of this article,

28
00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:36,100
 two local administrations in Ensemble Montréal confirmed

29
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:39,100
 the dismantlement hivernal of two different axes.

30
00:01:39,100 --> 00:01:40,100
 On the street of Terrebonne,

31
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:42,300
 one side of the pistes was retired during the summer.

32
00:01:42,300 --> 00:01:44,300
 And in the city of Cartierville,

33
00:01:44,300 --> 00:01:46,300
 five pistes cyclables of the Central District

34
00:01:46,300 --> 00:01:50,300
 have already been completely suppressed for the season hivernal.

35
00:01:50,300 --> 00:01:51,900
 However, the pistes of the Central District

36
00:01:51,900 --> 00:01:54,300
 were part of those analyzed in Ensemble Montréal,

37
00:01:54,300 --> 00:01:55,700
 which did not recommend, I repeat,

38
00:01:55,700 --> 00:01:57,300
 no dismantlement.

39
00:01:57,300 --> 00:02:00,500
 In summary, the administration has spent $1 million for analysis,

40
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:03,500
 saw that it did not recommend any dismantlement,

41
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:06,500
 and took the decision to dismantle it in season.

42
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:10,300
 In the result, we will pay again to modify,

43
00:02:10,300 --> 00:02:14,500
 remove and eventually reinstall the settlements already paid by the contributors.

44
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:16,500
 My question is the following:

45
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:18,500
 How can the mairesse justify

46
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:20,500
 that its administration spends public funds

47
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:21,500
 to command a analysis

48
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:24,700
 that we do not want to respect the conclusions?

49
